# "When that creature dies this turn": the delayed trigger (CR 603.7b) and the +2/+0 last only until the turn ends.
# Ornithopter is back to 0 power on turn three, where Lightning Bolt kills it and Bot1 draws nothing beyond its
# turn-three draw (Guerrilla Gorilla; the Island under it stays in the library). Beside the positive control in
# a-good-day-to-die-draws-when-the-pumped-creature-dies.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Ornithopter
A Good Day to Die
Lightning Bolt
Island x2
Guerrilla Gorilla
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
